<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mrs. Burney returns for her yearly preventive visit, ten days after starting anastrozole and four weeks after her right mastectomy. The seroma did not recur after one aspiration, and her wound has healed. Her shoulder movement is nearly full with daily exercises. She has had no hot flashes or joint aches yet on anastrozole and takes vitamin D daily. She walks 30 minutes a day and has begun writing again in the mornings. She completed the health risk assessment before the visit. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Visit</td><td>Adult preventive visit, age 59</td></tr><tr><td>Active conditions</td><td>Right breast cancer after mastectomy, on anastrozole; low bone mass</td></tr><tr><td>Medicines</td><td>Anastrozole 1 mg daily; vitamin D3 1000 units daily</td></tr><tr><td>Recent events</td><td>Seroma aspirated once, three weeks ago; resolved</td></tr><tr><td>Functional status</td><td>Independent; walking 30 minutes a day</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>Health risk assessment. Completed by the patient before the visit and reviewed during the visit. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Domain</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Self-rated health</td><td>Good, and recovering well from surgery</td></tr><tr><td>Psychosocial</td><td>Close to her husband and son; many friends visit; no financial strain; feels safe at home</td></tr><tr><td>Behavioral</td><td>Never smoker; a glass of wine with dinner two or three times a week; walks 30 minutes a day; diet with dairy most days</td></tr><tr><td>Activities of daily living</td><td>Independent in all</td></tr><tr><td>Instrumental activities of daily living</td><td>Manages her own medicines, money, correspondence, and household</td></tr><tr><td>Home safety</td><td>Smoke detectors working; wears a seat belt; no falls</td></tr><tr><td>Hearing and vision</td><td>Reading glasses; eye examination last year; no hearing concern</td></tr><tr><td>Sleep</td><td>About seven hours a night</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

