    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with her consent, prompted by her cancer diagnosis. She has named a health care agent and completed a written health care directive today, now scanned into the chart. She wants to be told plainly and in advance what any treatment would involve. If the cancer returned she would want treatment that offered a real chance of control while she could still live independently and write; she would not want resuscitation or prolonged life support if recovery to independent life were not expected. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
